# Composite Reflectivity (dBZ) — NWS-enhanced ramp
# Format: value R G B A
# Use with: gdaldem color-relief -alpha  (NO -nearest_color_entry: refc
# interpolates via the interpolate_color flag for smooth gradients)
# NOTE: gdaldem rejects inline comments on data rows — keep them bare.
nv     0   0   0   0
-30    0   0   0   0
0      0   0   0   0
5      100 230 230 90
10     60  160 245 170
15     30  80  230 220
20     20  220 40  255
25     16  180 16  255
30     0   140 0   255
35     250 245 0   255
40     230 190 0   255
45     255 150 0   255
50     250 0   0   255
55     210 0   0   255
60     190 0   0   255
65     250 0   245 255
70     150 80  200 255
75     255 255 255 255
